      "en": "**Parameters** are the names in the function’s definition (`function fee(city, weight)`), and **arguments** are the values you pass when calling (`fee(\"Giza\", 3)`). Order matters. Pass fewer than needed and the missing ones are undefined; pass more and the extra ones are ignored. Once there are more than 3 inputs, pass an **object** (next lesson)."
