      "en": "A function named `processOrder` that cleans, calculates, sends an email and writes to the sheet is hard to test and hard to change in part. Split it: `cleanOrder`, `computeTotal`, `sendEmail` and `saveRow`, plus a main function calling them in order. The name starts with a verb (`get`, `clean`, `build`, `is`, `send`) and says exactly what it does."
